  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCLUSION OF PEOPLE WITH DISABILITY IN MOZAMBIQUE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Diversity and Inclusion on Climate Change and Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights project in Mozambique, implemented by Association TV Surdo, aims to support people with disabilities to improve health and climate emergency preparedness. The key activities include: Training PWD in sexual and reproductive health and climate emergencies; produce TV Contents about PWD rights; advocacy and lobby actions in 7 provinces (Maputo, Gaza, Inhambane, Sofala, Zamb&#xe9;zia, Nampula and Cabo Delgado).</narrative>
  </description>
